  "description": "Street Energy: A Comic Graffiti Font\nBring the roar of the city to your designs with Street Energy, a high-octane display font that fuses the punchy aesthetics of comic book lettering with the raw edge of street graffiti. Featuring bold, overlapping characters and sharp, dynamic angles, this typeface captures a sense of perpetual motion and urban grit. It is the ultimate choice for extreme sports branding, graphic novel titles, streetwear logos, and high-impact event posters. Whether you’re designing for a skate shop or a superhero cover, Street Energy delivers a “vandal-chic” look that won’t be ignored!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Street Energy: A Comic Graffiti Font</p>\n<p>Bring the roar of the city to your designs with Street Energy, a high-octane display font that fuses the punchy aesthetics of comic book lettering with the raw edge of street graffiti. Featuring bold, overlapping characters and sharp, dynamic angles, this typeface captures a sense of perpetual motion and urban grit. It is the ultimate choice for extreme sports branding, graphic novel titles, streetwear logos, and high-impact event posters. Whether you’re designing for a skate shop or a superhero cover, Street Energy delivers a “vandal-chic” look that won’t be ignored!</p>",
